{"3905070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Treasure Cove", "steam_appid": 3905070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4983480], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT IS TREASURE COVE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treasure Cove</strong> is a co-op survival horror adventure where <strong>you and your friends</strong> sail to a mysterious island in search of lost treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/5833157e1cd28224fe1996ce37c217be.poster.avif?t=1786524812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/5833157e1cd28224fe1996ce37c217be.webm?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/5833157e1cd28224fe1996ce37c217be.mp4?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROXIMITY VOICE CHAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate with your friends using <strong>proximity voice chat</strong>. Call for help, warn your crew about danger, and coordinate your search in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/9c524c6d3b2e2240b16ed035101ec87f.poster.avif?t=1786524812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/9c524c6d3b2e2240b16ed035101ec87f.webm?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/9c524c6d3b2e2240b16ed035101ec87f.mp4?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE MYSTERIOUS ISLAND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> dangerous locations, use special tools to uncover hidden loot, <strong>sell</strong> what you find, <strong>upgrade</strong> your gear, and <strong>try</strong> to make it back to your ship before the island’s monsters find you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/3fced5ac910c86396ce70e5ef1e266c9.poster.avif?t=1786524812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/3fced5ac910c86396ce70e5ef1e266c9.webm?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/3fced5ac910c86396ce70e5ef1e266c9.mp4?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>USE TOOLS TO FIND HIDDEN LOOT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tools are your best chance to find treasure and make it back alive. Use a radar to detect buried valuables, a shovel to dig them up, and a flashlight to explore dark places where danger may be waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/47e705c176273f6db7913cf56a12939a.poster.avif?t=1786524812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/47e705c176273f6db7913cf56a12939a.webm?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/47e705c176273f6db7913cf56a12939a.mp4?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STAY QUIET OR GET HUNTED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is home to horrifying entities that stalk you in the darkness. Make too much noise, wander too far, or explore carelessly, and the hunt can quickly turn against you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/b0814f4c660e83615452d870b59f23e2.poster.avif?t=1786524812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/b0814f4c660e83615452d870b59f23e2.webm?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/b0814f4c660e83615452d870b59f23e2.mp4?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE &amp; ESCAPE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move carefully, stay alive, and return to the ship with your loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/99f792864b9cd20a69071c084dece66c.poster.avif?t=1786524812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/99f792864b9cd20a69071c084dece66c.webm?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/99f792864b9cd20a69071c084dece66c.mp4?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Survival Horror</strong> — explore the island with your friends and survive each expedition.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treasure Hunting</strong> — search for hidden treasures buried across the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proximity Voice Chat</strong> — communicate with your crew, but be careful: noise can attract monsters.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Useful Tools</strong> — use a radar, shovel, flashlight, and map to find loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell &amp; Upgrade</strong> — sell treasures and buy better equipment for the next hunt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dangerous Monsters</strong> — use light or avoid terrifying creatures stalking the island.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br><br></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT IS TREASURE COVE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treasure Cove</strong> is a co-op survival horror adventure where <strong>you and your friends</strong> sail to a mysterious island in search of lost treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/5833157e1cd28224fe1996ce37c217be.poster.avif?t=1786524812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/5833157e1cd28224fe1996ce37c217be.webm?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/5833157e1cd28224fe1996ce37c217be.mp4?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROXIMITY VOICE CHAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_pa